  "instructions": [
    "Preheat your tagine or Dutch oven to 300°F (150°C).",
    "In a small bowl, whisk together lemon juice, honey, salt, and black pepper.",
    "Add sliced red onion and minced garlic to the bowl and toss to coat.",
    "Add sliced fresh ginger to the bowl and toss to coat.",
    "Place the fatty salmon fillets in the preheated tagine or Dutch oven.",
    "Pour the marinade over the salmon fillets and cook for 12-15 minutes or until cooked through.",
    "Remove the tagine or Dutch oven from the heat and stir in chopped fresh parsley and mint.",
    "Place the cooked salmon fillets on a serving platter and garnish with additional parsley and mint if desired.",
    "Serve immediately, garnished with ice cubes for a refreshing touch."
  ],
